---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Corporate Training & Enterprise AI Governance Upskilling | RKMIDIGILABS"
  description="Custom enterprise corporate training in AI Governance, ISO/IEC 42001, EU AI Act compliance, and cybersecurity risk management for boards, executives, and engineering teams."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0b1a33] via-[#112649] to-[#071326] text-white py-16 lg:py-24 border-b border-[#1d3d75] overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_70%_20%,rgba(22,163,74,0.12),transparent_60%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-500/40 text-emerald-300 text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-4">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          Enterprise Workforce Enablement
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight text-white">
          Corporate Training in <span class="text-emerald-400">AI Governance</span>, Cyber Risk & Regulatory Compliance
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Empower cross-functional teams, board directors, and technical architects to deploy generative AI safely, comply with global regulations (EU AI Act, ISO 42001, NIST AI RMF), and safeguard enterprise infrastructure.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a 
            href="#corporate-tracks" 
            class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-[#16A34A] hover:bg-[#15803D] text-white shadow-md transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Explore Enterprise Tracks</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a 
            href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com?subject=Enterprise%20Corporate%20Training%20Consultation&body=Organization%20Name:%0ATeam%20Size:%0AFocus%20Area%20(Executive%20Briefing%20/%20ISO%2042001%20/%20AI%20Red-Teaming%20/%20Compliance):%0APreferred%20Timeline:" 
            class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-[#1a3869] hover:bg-[#254d93] text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Request Custom RFP Proposal</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Enterprise Metrics -->
  <section class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-black font-mono">500+</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600 mt-1">Executives & Engineers Trained</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-emerald-700 font-mono">100%</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600 mt-1">Custom Stack Tailored</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-[#112649] font-mono">CPE / CEU</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600 mt-1">Accredited Hours Provided</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-emerald-700 font-mono">98.4%</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600 mt-1">Client Recommendation Rate</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Corporate Programs / Tracks -->
  <section id="corporate-tracks" class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#16A34A] mb-2">Cohort Curricula</h2>
        <p class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-black">
          Tailored Programs Across the Organizational Hierarchy
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          From board directors establishing AI risk appetite to software developers hardening LLM pipelines, our corporate modules are customized to your tech stack, compliance environment, and risk profile.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Track 1: Executive Briefing -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-600 transition-all bg-white shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 border border-blue-200">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/></svg>
                Half-Day / Full-Day Intensive
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-600 font-bold">C-Suite & Board</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-black">
              Executive & Boardroom AI Governance Briefing
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Equip senior leadership and risk committees with the strategic insights required to govern artificial intelligence deployments without stalling organizational innovation.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-6 space-y-2.5">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-800">Key Focus Modules:</div>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  <span><strong>Fiduciary AI Duties:</strong> Liabilities under the EU AI Act, SEC Cybersecurity disclosures, and global privacy frameworks.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  <span><strong>Shadow AI Policy:</strong> Instituting corporate acceptable use guidelines and automated telemetry over unauthorized GenAI tools.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  <span><strong>AI Risk Appetite Formulation:</strong> Establishing enterprise tolerance metrics for hallucination, bias, and operational disruption.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium">Format: In-Person or Executive Virtual</span>
            <a 
              href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com?subject=Executive%20Briefing%20Inquiry"
              class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-[#112649] hover:bg-black text-white transition-all"
            >
              Request Briefing Agenda
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Track 2: Compliance, Legal & Risk Teams -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-600 transition-all bg-white shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
                2-Day Intensive Cohort
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-600 font-bold">Legal, Risk & Compliance</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-black">
              Legal, Risk & Compliance AI Masterclass
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Practical guidance for General Counsel, DPOs, and Compliance Officers navigating model documentation, vendor AI agreements, and mandatory conformity assessments.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-6 space-y-2.5">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-800">Key Focus Modules:</div>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  <span><strong>AI System Classification:</strong> High-risk determination matrices under EU AI Act Annex III and ISO 42001 impact sizing.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  <span><strong>Third-Party AI Diligence:</strong> Auditing external foundation model vendors (OpenAI, Anthropic, Mistral) for privacy and data leakage.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  <span><strong>FRIA & DPIA Alignment:</strong> Conducting Fundamental Rights and Data Protection Impact Assessments side-by-side.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium">Format: Interactive Virtual / Hybrid</span>
            <a 
              href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com?subject=Legal%20Risk%20Training%20Inquiry"
              class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-[#112649] hover:bg-black text-white transition-all"
            >
              Get Course Syllabus
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Track 3: Technical & AI Engineering -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-600 transition-all bg-white shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"/></svg>
                3-Day Hands-On Lab
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-600 font-bold">ML & Cyber Engineers</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-black">
              Engineering Red-Teaming & Guardrail Bootcamp
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Deep-dive technical workshop for ML engineers, DevSecOps, and cybersecurity analysts to build defense-in-depth protections against adversarial LLM attacks.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-6 space-y-2.5">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-800">Key Focus Modules:</div>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  <span><strong>OWASP LLM Red-Teaming:</strong> Hands-on exploitation of direct & indirect prompt injections, RAG poisoning, and system prompt leakage.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  <span><strong>Guardrail Architectures:</strong> Implementing NeMo Guardrails, Llama-Guard, input sanitization, and output semantic validation.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  <span><strong>Synthetic Media Watermarking:</strong> Engineering C2PA cryptographic manifests and statistical watermarking under EU AI Act Art. 50.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium">Format: Sandbox Cloud Labs</span>
            <a 
