                  <span><strong>Audit Workpaper Automation:</strong> Establishing standardized audit sampling, non-conformity reporting, and corrective action workflows.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium">Format: On-Site or Virtual Classroom</span>
            <a 
              href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com?subject=ISO%2042001%20Auditor%20Training%20Inquiry"
              class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-[#112649] hover:bg-black text-white transition-all"
            >
              Request Syllabus
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Enterprise Delivery Models -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-slate-50 border-t border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#16A34A] mb-2">Flexible Logistics</h2>
        <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black">
