            Delivered directly at your corporate headquarters or global facilities. Tailored discussions around your proprietary models, internal policies, and restricted environments.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
