          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-black">Enterprise LMS Integration</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            SCORM-compliant modules and API integration directly into Cornerstone, Workday Learning, or your internal LMS for continuous compliance tracking.
          </p>
